              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td style="height:4px; background-color:#C9A227; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:36px 32px 28px 32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0; color:#C9A227; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase;">Trial reminder</p>
              <h1 style="margin:0 0 22px 0; color:#003D5C; font-size:26px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:700;">Your SGC trial ends in 3 days</h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#1f2937; font-size:15px; line-height:1.65;">Hello <strong><t t-out="object.l3_admin_name or object.partner_id.name"/></strong>,</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#1f2937; font-size:15px; line-height:1.65;">Your 14-day trial of <strong>SGC Real Estate Operating System</strong> is coming to an end. On the date below, your saved card will be charged for the next billing period according to your Order Form.</p>
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:22px 0; background-color:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left:4px solid #C9A227; border-radius:4px;">
                <tr><td style="padding:18px 20px;">
                  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
                    <tr>
                      <td width="150" style="color:#6b7280; font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.6px; padding:3px 0;">Trial ends</td>
                      <td style="color:#003D5C; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; padding:3px 0;"><t t-out="object.l3_trial_ends_at"/></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0;">
                    <tr>
                      <td width="150" style="color:#6b7280; font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.6px; padding:3px 0;">Workspace</td>
                      <td style="color:#003D5C; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; padding:3px 0;"><t t-out="object.l3_tenant_url"/></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td></tr>
              </table>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#1f2937; font-size:15px; line-height:1.65;">If your card fails on the renewal day, your workspace will be <strong>immediately locked</strong> (no grace period, per your Order Form). Please ensure your card details are up to date before the renewal date.</p>
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:26px 0 8px 0;">
                <tr><td style="background-color:#003D5C; border-radius:4px;">
                  <a t-attf-href="/my/layer3/{{ object.id }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 26px; color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0.4px;">Manage billing</a>
                </td></tr>
              </table>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#1f2937; font-size:15px; line-height:1.65;">If you have any questions, simply reply to this email and our team will assist you.</p>
              <p style="margin:30px 0 0 0; color:#1f2937; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Regards,</p>
              <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; color:#003D5C; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; font-weight:700;">SGC TECH AI</p>
              <p style="margin:2px 0 0 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:13px;">hello@sgctech.ai</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 30px 32px;">
              <div style="border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top:18px; color:#6b7280; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6;">You are receiving this email because you have an active SGC Real Estate OS trial.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#003D5C; padding:18px 32px; color:#cbd5e1; font-size:10px; line-height:1.6; text-align:center;">
              SGC Tech AI (Scholarix Global Consultant FZE) &middot; Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br/>
              This email was sent to <t t-out="object.l3_admin_email"/>.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
            ]]></field>
        </record>
